cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released results, please cite this repository and the paper."
title: "CoreGate: Execution-Lineage Supervision for Attack Technique Recognition under Environment Shift"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and released experiment artifacts for CoreGate, an
  approach that converts process associations recorded in execution journals
  into training-only foreground supervision for attack-technique recognition.
  The package contains the encoder and gated-readout training code, the locked
  leave-one-environment-out results, the ablation, holdout and statistics
  audits, and the dataset metadata and catalog.
